      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://nearbylens.com/cities/usa/ia/aredale/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Each year, Aredale hosts the Butler County Fair, featuring livestock shows and tractor pulls that celebrate the region’s agricultural heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
